-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ב/11: ביצוע שעה פרונטאלית במקום שעה תומכת הוראה ברפורמת
-- עוז לתמורה
-- Teaching a frontal hour in place of a teaching-support hour under the Oz
-- LaTmura reform (full and partial implementation): who may, with whose
-- agreement, what it pays (125% of the hourly value in place of the support
-- hour's pay), the weekly caps, and the unchanged weekly quota.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `תשע"ב/11 ביצוע שעה פרונטאלית במקום שעה תומכת הוראה ברפורמת עוז לתמורה`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, title, date (30.5.2012), and the lead-in: the agreement of 14.8.2011 on Oz LaTmura in the upper divisions, and the circular's purpose (a frontal hour in place of a support hour, in full and partial implementation); no rule of its own.

@desc How the Oz LaTmura reform applies to the teacher.
DECLARE `implementation` IS ONE OF
    `full implementation`
    `partial implementation`

@desc The school years section 2 names.
DECLARE `school year` IS ONE OF
    `תשע"ב (2011/12)`
    `תשע"ג (2012/13)`
    `תשע"ד (2013/14)`

@desc A teacher under Oz LaTmura in one school week, as far as this circular asks about it.
DECLARE `Oz teacher` HAS
    `in the upper division of an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS A BOOLEAN
    `reform implementation`              IS AN `implementation`
    `in school year`                     IS A `school year`
    `position`                           IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position (1 = 100%)
    `beyond a full position as the agreement allows` IS A BOOLEAN @desc a position above 100% is held under the conditions the reform agreement sets
    `hourly value`                       IS A NUMBER @desc the teacher's hourly value (ערך שעה), shekels
    `frontal hours in place of support hours` IS A NUMBER @desc weekly frontal hours taught in place of teaching-support hours
    `agreed with the principal`          IS A BOOLEAN @desc coordinated with the school principal, within the system's needs

DECLARE `frontal-hour action` IS ONE OF
    `teach a frontal hour in place of a support hour` HAS `hours substituted` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the frontal-hour reward` HAS `reward paid` IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 תחולה`

@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `this circular applies to` t IF
    t's `in the upper division of an owner supervised by the Ministry`

§§ `2 ביצוע שעה פרונטאלית`

-- akn:art_2/p1 The agreement's rules on the structure of the work week (sections 9ג and 26ז); this circular departs from them, below.
-- akn:art_2/p2 The departure rests on the letter of 10.5.2012 from the senior deputy Wage Commissioner; the decision follows.

-- Section 2: a teacher "employed in FULL implementation … at 100% (or
-- more …) BOTH in full and partial implementation" may teach a frontal hour
-- in place of a support hour (for preparing materials and grading), with the
-- principal and within the system's needs. F-2011-12_tashab_11-a: one
-- sentence names full implementation alone and both. The reading adopted:
-- both, as section 1's scope and the caps for partial implementation below
-- say.
@ref akn:art_2/p3 akn:art_2/p4
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may teach a frontal hour in place of a support hour` t IF
        `this circular applies to` t
    AND (   t's `position` EQUALS 1
         OR (t's `position` GREATER THAN 1 AND t's `beyond a full position as the agreement allows`))
    AND t's `agreed with the principal`

GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may on the words "employed in full implementation"` t IF
        `may teach a frontal hour in place of a support hour` t
    AND t's `reform implementation` EQUALS `full implementation`

`a partial-implementation teacher at 100% in תשע"ג` MEANS
    `Oz teacher` WITH
        `in the upper division of an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `reform implementation`              IS `partial implementation`
        `in school year`                     IS `תשע"ג (2012/13)`
        `position`                           IS 1
        `beyond a full position as the agreement allows` IS FALSE
        `hourly value`                       IS 100
        `frontal hours in place of support hours` IS 2
        `agreed with the principal`          IS TRUE

`the sentence admits partial implementation and also confines it to full` MEANS
        `may teach a frontal hour in place of a support hour` `a partial-implementation teacher at 100% in תשע"ג`
    AND (NOT `may on the words "employed in full implementation"` `a partial-implementation teacher at 100% in תשע"ג`)
#ASSERT `the sentence admits partial implementation and also confines it to full`

-- The weekly caps: up to 5 in full implementation; in partial
-- implementation up to 2 in תשע"ג and 3 in תשע"ד. F-2011-12_tashab_11-b: no
-- cap is set for partial implementation in תשע"ב, the year the circular is
-- issued in. The reading adopted: none may be substituted then — the
-- permission is given only with its cap.
@ref akn:art_2/p7 akn:art_2/p8
GIVEN i IS AN `implementation`, y IS A `school year`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the cap section 2 sets` i y IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `full implementation` THEN JUST 5
    WHEN `partial implementation` THEN
        CONSIDER y
        WHEN `תשע"ג (2012/13)` THEN JUST 2
        WHEN `תשע"ד (2013/14)` THEN JUST 3
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

`no cap is set for partial implementation in תשע"ב` MEANS
    isNothing (`the cap section 2 sets` `partial implementation` `תשע"ב (2011/12)`)
#ASSERT `no cap is set for partial implementation in תשע"ב`

GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the weekly cap for` t IS
    fromMaybe 0 (`the cap section 2 sets` (t's `reform implementation`) (t's `in school year`))

-- The reward: 125% of the hourly value for each frontal hour taught in
-- place of a support hour, and not the support hour's own pay — so 25% of
-- the hourly value over the regular salary.
@ref akn:art_2/p5 akn:art_2/p6
`the reward rate` MEANS 1.25
`the support hour's own pay rate` MEANS 1

#ASSERT `the reward rate` MINUS `the support hour's own pay rate` EQUALS 0.25

@export default The weekly addition over the regular salary a teacher under Oz LaTmura earns for frontal hours taught in place of teaching-support hours under circular תשע"ב/11
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher` @desc the teacher in the week
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the weekly frontal-hour addition` t IS
    IF `may teach a frontal hour in place of a support hour` t
    THEN min (t's `frontal hours in place of support hours`) (`the weekly cap for` t)
         TIMES t's `hourly value`
         TIMES (`the reward rate` MINUS `the support hour's own pay rate`)
    ELSE 0

-- The permission, as a regulative rule: the teacher MAY substitute up to
-- the cap. Time in weeks.
GIVEN t IS AN `Oz teacher`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `frontal-hour action`
DECIDE `substituting frontal hours` t IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MAY   `teach a frontal hour in place of a support hour` `hours`
          PROVIDED `may teach a frontal hour in place of a support hour` t AND `hours` AT MOST `the weekly cap for` t
    WITHIN 1
    HENCE PARTY `the employer`
          MUST  `pay the frontal-hour reward` `reward`
                PROVIDED `reward` AT LEAST `hours` TIMES t's `hourly value` TIMES `the reward rate`
          WITHIN 4
          LEST BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 2: a frontal hour taught in place of a support hour is paid 125% of the hourly value"

-- The weekly quota is not reduced: 40 hours at 100% in full
-- implementation, 32 in partial implementation in תשע"ג and 36 in תשע"ד.
@ref akn:art_2/p9
GIVEN i IS AN `implementation`, y IS A `school year`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the weekly quota at 100%` i y IS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `full implementation` THEN JUST 40
    WHEN `partial implementation` THEN
        CONSIDER y
        WHEN `תשע"ג (2012/13)` THEN JUST 32
        WHEN `תשע"ד (2013/14)` THEN JUST 36
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

`the substitution reduces the weekly quota` MEANS FALSE

-- akn:conclusions The contact line for questions, the sign-off and signature; no rule.

-- Worked examples; the hourly value of 100 is a placeholder.
`a full-implementation teacher substituting 6 hours` MEANS
    `Oz teacher` WITH
        `in the upper division of an owner supervised by the Ministry` IS TRUE
        `reform implementation`              IS `full implementation`
        `in school year`                     IS `תשע"ג (2012/13)`
        `position`                           IS 1
        `beyond a full position as the agreement allows` IS FALSE
        `hourly value`                       IS 100
        `frontal hours in place of support hours` IS 6
        `agreed with the principal`          IS TRUE

#ASSERT `the weekly frontal-hour addition` `a full-implementation teacher substituting 6 hours` EQUALS 125
#ASSERT `the weekly frontal-hour addition` `a partial-implementation teacher at 100% in תשע"ג` EQUALS 50

#TRACE `substituting frontal hours` `a partial-implementation teacher at 100% in תשע"ג` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the teaching employee` DOES `teach a frontal hour in place of a support hour` 2 AT 0
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the frontal-hour reward` 250 AT 3
